<title>HONG KONG: HK airport authority awards HK$13.2 mln contract.</title>
<headline>HK airport authority awards HK$13.2 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Airport Authority said in a statement it awarded on Friday a HK$13.2 million contract to Advance Specialist Treatment Engineering Ltd for epoxy floor finishes in the passenger terminal building of the territory's new airport being built.</p>
<p>The statement gave no information about the firm.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
